🎯 Practical Example

Suppose I have a production EC2 server.

I want to receive an alert if CPU goes above 80%.

Step 1 — Monitor Metric
EC2 CPUUtilization
Step 2 — Create Alarm
IF CPU > 80%
Step 3 — Trigger SNS
CloudWatch Alarm
       ↓
SNS
       ↓
Email Notification

Now whenever the CPU crosses the configured threshold, I can receive an alert.

